 /  \/
	History

	05-09-93 V1.00

	The first version created and I doubt that there will be further
	versions :)

	05-29-93 V1.01

	How lucky you are, there came a new version.. I can only say that
	this one is a bit faster for the user to execute and uses less
	lines..

	12-14-93 V2.00

	Now the door is coded in C for even faster execution time.
	Configuration file added.

	06-14-94 V2.01

	The door has now the abillity to accept fast commands like C 3.

